# Admin console / multi-tenant control-plane spike (2026-07-29)
#
# A complete but UNDEPLOYED body of work: a web console for creating tenants,
# its API Lambda, a metrics emitter, IAM/infra scaffolding and their tests.
# Kept out of git deliberately while it is still a spike. Nothing here has
# been created in AWS.
#
# Context and how to resume: .claude/HANDOFF.md (also ignored).
# The worker's metrics wiring was reverted; the diff is preserved at
# .claude/patches/worker-metrics-wiring.patch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
admin-console/
ivvy_metrics.py
ARCHITECTURE.md
tests/test_admin_api.py
tests/test_ivvy_metrics.py

